 "_comment": [
  "Seed list for the school picker, from the ESLP application forms (2022,",
  "2023, 2025) in the EdLight shared drive — the 'Établissement scolaire'",
  "column only. No applicant name, email or phone is included, and rows",
  "shifted by '|' characters inside free-text answers were dropped.",
  "",
  "NO COMMUNE, deliberately. An earlier version of this file carried one,",
  "inferred from the application's 'Addresse de residence' — which is where",
  "the STUDENT lives, not where the school is. The sixteen applicants from",
  "Saint-Louis de Gonzague live in Ruelle Vaillant, Carrefour-Feuilles,",
  "Laboule, Delmas 33, Tabarre 15, Pétion-Ville and Clercine; treating those",
  "as the school's location split one real school into two.",
  "",
  "So a school is one entry per name, nationally. A location is only recorded",
  "when a student adds a school themselves and types the school's own address.",
  "",
  "`applicants` is how many applications named the school; the picker shows",
  "the most-attended first.",
  "",
  "Two entries name the same school twice, once with the place written out",
  "(« de Pétion-ville », « de Turgeau »); they are merged. École Immaculée",
  "Conception de Trou-du-Nord is NOT merged with École Immaculée Conception:",
  "Trou-du-Nord is in the Nord-Est, not the same school.",
  "",
  "Lives under shared/ because Metro only watches that folder — both the web",
  "app and the mobile app import this same file."
 ],
